    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d112">

                <pb facs="0206" n="126" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg126"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hutchinson to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-09-22"><hi rendition="#italic">September 22,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Chile-Argentine treaty ratifications exchanged here 4 o’clock to-day. Government
                    now fully turning attention to national improvements, railways, bridges,
                    suppression drunkenness, and consideration of States with whom best to have
                    commercial relations. Argentine commission under General Campos being
                    enthusiastically entertained here now. General prosperity seems assured.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hutchinson.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
